        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      },
      {
        "id": "exclusion-of-other-NBIA",
        "description": "Exclusion of other neurodegeneration with brain iron accumulation (NBIA) disorders by genetic and clinical evaluation",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of biallelic pathogenic COASY variants plus clinical features of progressive dystonia/parkinsonism and supportive neuroimaging findings",
    "notes": "Diagnosis relies heavily on genetic confirmation combined with characteristic clinical and imaging features."
